From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shayne <8741557+shaynelegault@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:25:39 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] mtd: apple-sftl: Rotate the healthy replicated PPN VFL banks

Verify the source checkpoint, all lane tables and any later table updates before touching the alternate bank. Erase and verify its four members, publish the checkpoint that references the old tables, copy the tables, then publish their new references. Read back every replica and retain the source on every error. Exercise both directions and interrupted operations with a qualified synthetic SLC backend.

Assisted-by: LLM
